  "examples": "kl-help\n  list every command\nkl-help kl-slab\n  explain kl-slab",
  "notes": "The argument must be namespaced: ``kl-help kl-slab`` or ``kl-help kernlens-slab``.  A bare ``kl-help slab`` is rejected, because KernLens commands live in their own namespace and a bare name would read like a query about a GDB command.",
